  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir together:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>japanese mayonnaise (kewpie) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"60\">60 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.25\" data-alt=\"1\">¼ cup</span>)</span></span></li><li>sriracha (for the mayo) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>lime juice <span class=\"amt\">a splash</span></li></ul></li><li>Set aside for the top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
