   "title": "Spicy mayo",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the tuna into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 mm</span> cubes (or mince it).</li><li>Toss in a bowl with:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>sriracha <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"3\">3 tsp</span></span></li><li>toasted sesame oil <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li><li>green onions <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-n=\"1\">2</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Keep a few scallion rounds back for the top.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Spicy tuna",
    "diagram": null,
