     "name_html": "Sashimi-grade tuna"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<p>Peel the mango and cut it into sticks about <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> thick, as long as you can.</p>",
   "heat": null,
