     "name_html": "Mango, ripe but firm"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bamboo mat with the slats running sideways, a sheet of plastic wrap on top.</li><li>Half a sheet of nori on the plastic, <b>shiny side down</b> — rough side up.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Set up the mat",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Nori rough side up on plastic wrap over the mat.",
      "src": "illustrations/tuna-mango-roll/4-how1.webp"
     }
    ],
