     "name_html": "Nori"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the tezu and wet your fingers in it.</li><li>Spread <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"110\" data-s=\"0\">110 g</span> of rice evenly over the <b>whole</b> nori, right to the edges — it ends up outside.</li><li>Sprinkle with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 tbsp</span> sesame seeds.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-5",
